te":"时县寄治蠡城〖8〗，城堑不固；逵从琰求兵修城。诸欲为乱者皆不隐其谋，故逵得尽诛之。遂修城拒琰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":107},{"id":"liusima-q-588f37f5363770e4b6f6","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"河内张晟众万余人，无所属，寇崤、渑间〖4〗。河东卫固、弘农张琰，各起兵以应之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":119,"end":157},{"id":"liusima-q-b9c4047b1c9d65250923","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d8dd6ec12bdbdd51bd80","layer":"original","quote":"高幹之反，张琰将举兵以应之。逵不知其谋，往见琰。闻变起，欲还。恐见执，乃为琰画计，如与同谋者；琰信之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":10,"end":60},{"id":"rensu-q-6ab1e9aaca52ff1df056","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"固等使兵数千人绝陕津〖1〗，畿至，不得渡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"rensu-q-6fc011d0311d47d96ae9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遣夏侯惇讨之，未至","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":32},{"id":"rensu-q-b29d927d6d43065dbf63","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"会大兵至，幹、晟败，固等伏诛","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":112,"end":126},{"id":"rensu-q-fbe9acf14b201e7901fa","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"上党诸县杀长吏，弘农执郡守","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":34},{"id":"zhonghua-q-4bed0765b0b21f7a220b","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"其后河东卫固作乱，与张晟、张琰及高幹等并为寇；繇又率诸将讨破之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":228,"end":260}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
